# Unfreeze

Clear the task's advisory edit boundary. If a verified gstack freeze state is in use, resolve its exact `GSTACK_STATE_ROOT` with the installed `gstack-paths` helper, inspect `freeze-dir.txt`, and remove only that state file. Report which state was cleared.

This does not disable independent filesystem permissions, host approval policies, or unrelated hooks. If no gstack freeze state exists, say so; do not claim host restrictions were removed.
